\f0\fs20\b QuickPrompt - Installation information\b0\par\par
QuickPrompt is a local Windows launcher for your LLM prompts, documents and Windows shortcuts.\par\par
This setup installs QuickPrompt for your Windows account. Administrator rights and a separate .NET installation are not required.\par\par
The application is installed under Local AppData\line Programs\line QuickPrompt. It is added to the Start menu and starts hidden in the system tray when you sign in. Press Alt+Space to show it.\par\par
Your prompts and settings are stored separately under Local AppData\line QuickPrompt. Existing prompts are preserved. Removing the application leaves your prompts, settings and document folders intact.\par\par
Close QuickPrompt before upgrading or removing it. You can disable automatic startup in Windows Settings, Apps, Startup.\par\par
The bundled Microsoft .NET runtime has its own license and third-party notices, included in the installation folder.\par
